<title>THAILAND: Singer 95/96 year net rises.</title>
<headline>Singer 95/96 year net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the year ended June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>			(in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		38.45     vs	    44.38</p>
<p>    Net			655.68     vs	   599.10</p>
<p>NOTES: Fourth quarter figures not available. Earnings per share calculated from number of common shares issued at year-end at 24.28 baht vs 22.19 baht.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Singer Thailand Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-252-9950</p>
</text>
